                line: "Oh, okay. Well... say, I was wondering. Could I... Could I join you? To be honest, I\'m not too good at this whole adventuring thing. I\'ve gotten robbed twice, almost died three times, lost my way six times, forgotten where I am twelve times, and contracted at least three separate diseases. I could really use someone who knows what they\'re doing",
